y can explain: endless empty rooms and corridors that rearrange themselves whenever no one is looking.\n\nThe first team came back with strange objects the company had never seen. Some were worthless. Some were worth a fortune. The second team didn\u2019t come back at all.\n\nNow the company sends in crews like yours. You and up to three friends go through the door with bodycams rolling, grab whatever you can find, and try to make it back out. The further in you go, the rarer the finds, and the harder it is to find your way home.\n\nNobody knows what\u2019s on the other side. The company just wants what you bring back", "summary": "Co-op bodycam horror for 1 to 4 players. Scavenge a maze that changes every run, grab what you can, and decide how deep you\u2019re willing to go.", "themes": [{"id": 19, "name": "Horror"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/hazard-crew", "videos": [{"id": 202347, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "OaGnlczFxRQ", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OaGnlczFxRQ", "title": "Hazard Crew Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/OaGnlczFxRQ/sddefault.jpg"}], "game_localizations": [{"id": 63810, "region": {"id": 4, "name": "Europe", "category": "continent", "identifier": "EU"}}]}